			"notes": "## Changed\n\n- New pill titles for Thanos and six towns: Bucie, Bremminglar, Rymek, Ternaves, Lusuco and Maltic, each with its own subtitle and colors. Thanos gets a molten orange pill to match Rodoroc\n- Bucie's title shows when you enter the Entrance to Bucie territory\n- Llevigar now has an off-white pill with black text\n- Rodoroc now has a dark basalt pill with lava-orange text\n- Lutho now has a dark purple pill with white text\n- Cloth Config and Mod Menu are now optional. Wynn Wanderer runs with just Fabric API and Wynntils\n- Without Cloth Config, the settings come from `config/wynn-wanderer.toml`. Edit the file and restart the game to apply the changes\n- With Cloth Config and Mod Menu installed, the config screen works the same as before and saves to the same file\n- Mod Menu only shows the config button when Cloth Config is installed\n\n## Notes\n\n- Existing `wynn-wanderer.toml` files keep working, so you don't have to change anything\n- If the config file has a line Wynn Wanderer can't read, that option uses its default, the problem gets logged, and the file is left as is so you can fix it\n- New options get added to the config file automatically when you update"
		},
